<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JON" style="id">YON - Zigua Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Yona</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yon</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yona</para>
  <para style="toc1">Chitabu cha Yona</para>
  <para style="mt2">Chitabu cha</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yona</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGOZI</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Yona ni ntamulizi, chesimana vitendese ne vitabu vituhu vya wawoni. Chatamwila mbuli za muwoni yuwenga akutajwa lumwenga du mwe LAGANO DYA KALE mwe chitabu cha kaidi cha Maseuta sula ya 12:25.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yemndani</para>
  <para style="io">Nkongo Yona ajeza kwenega mwitango wa Chohile na nyumani afuzuma kugamba umo eze atimile mwitango uwo wa kwita kutambalisa kulondoka mbuli za kuchumilwa izo yeye nendile hazigonele. Wantu wa Ninawi weila amasa yawo, mbuli iyo haimuwagile Yona.</para>
  <para style="io">Hinyo kulu, Chohile mwenye alongoza walongi wakwe hata hegu hawakunga. Kaidi, mntu hakudaha kumwikiya Chohile mihaka ya ungi wakwe kwa wantu wakwe.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JON 1" />
  <para style="s">Yona amsumka Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 1:1" />Zuwa dimwenga Zumbe Chohile amgambaga Yona mwana ywa Amitali. <verse eid="JON 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 1:2" />Amgamba, “Konga ntambo wite komzi wa Ninawi, uwo mzi mkulu, ukawakwamile wantu wa kwikala umo, kwaviya siwona ubanasi wawo ukulisa.” <verse eid="JON 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 1:3" />Mna, Yona niyo akonga ntambo ya kwita ntendele ntuhu, kumsumka Zumbe Chohile. Kasela kubula komzi wa Yopa uko kambwila meli ikwita Talishishi. Niyo aliha idiyombe dye ntambo, akwela mwe meli atamba aita Talishishi chani amwenege Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="JON 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 1:4" />Mna Zumbe Chohile niyo avumiza nkung'unto mwe bahali, niyo kwalaila mjubwaniko mkulu mwe bahali, meli kenga ikantike. <verse eid="JON 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 1:5" />Watafi mwe meli niyo wogoha, chila yumwenga niyo akonga kumvikila mnungu ywakwe. Wadula izibaha zendile mndani mwe meli chani wahunguze uzami wakwe. Mna Yona niyo engila ntendele ntuhu imndani mwe meli kakugona fofofo.<verse eid="JON 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 1:6" />Mlongoza imeli niyo ambasa amgamba, “Vino ni mbwani ukugona, inuka ukamlombeze mnungu ywako, vyadahika uyo nachifile mbazi nakuhonya uwikazi wetu.”<verse eid="JON 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 1:7" />Watafi mwe meli wagambilana, “Haluse chidamanyeni tegatega chimanye ni yuhi ahosize ubanasi uno ukachimbwila.” Elo, niyo wadamanya tegatega. Tegatega idyo niyo dyamgwela Yona. <verse eid="JON 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 1:8" />Niyo wamgamba Yona, “Haluse chigambile, ni mbwani ubanasi uno uchibwila? Wadamanya ndimani? Walaila si yani? Kabila dyako ni dihi?”<verse eid="JON 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 1:9" />Yona niyo awahitula, “Miye ni Mwebulaniya.” “Namvikila Zumbe, Chohile ywa kwembingu aumbile isanga ne bahali.” <verse eid="JON 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 1:10" />Kawagambila kugamba nakamsumka Zumbe Chohile.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JON 1:10">Wadya wantu mwe meli weze weve ivyo niyo wogohesa, wamgamba, “Nimbwani ukadamnya saivyo?” <verse eid="JON 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JON 1:11" />Chipindi chose icho, nkung'unto naikajendeleza kujubwanisa ibahali, wantu mwe meli niyo wamuza “Chikutende mbwani chani bahali itondowale?”<verse eid="JON 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JON 1:12" />Yona awahitula, “Nidulani mwebahali, nkung'unto naileke. Kwaviya sivimanya kugamba nkung'unto ino iwabwilani kwachausa changu.”<verse eid="JON 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JON 1:13" />Wandima mwe meli hawamduile Yona, mna wajeza kuigala imeli mpwani mna wadunduga, kwaviya inkung'unto naitendesa. <verse eid="JON 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JON 1:14" />Niyo wamlombeza Zumbe Chohile wakagamba, “Chakulombeza weye Zumbe Chohile, usekuchikoma kwa kulavya ujima wa yuno mntu, naho usekuchikantila kwakwitila sakame ya mntu hena masa. Weye Zumbe Chohile, kudamanya viya ukunga.” <verse eid="JON 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JON 1:15" />Niyo wamgwila Yona wamdula mwe bahali, ahadya ibahali niyo yatondowala. <verse eid="JON 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JON 1:16" />Mbuli iyo iwatenda wandima mwe meli wamtunye Zumbe Chohile, niyo wamlaviza malavyo na kwika vyeliso.<verse eid="JON 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JON 1:17" />Zumbe Chohile, niyo alagiza samaki nkulu immele Yona, elo niyo atenda mndani mwe samaki kwa mazuwa matatu msi na chilo.<verse eid="JON 1:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JON 2" />
  <para style="s">1 Yona amlombeza Zumbe Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 2:1" />Umo mndani mwe samaki Yona niyo amlombeza Zumbe, Chohile ywakwe.<verse eid="JON 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 2:2" />Agamba, “Namwilila Zumbe Chohile kwachausa cha makunto yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:2">naye niyo anihitula</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:2">kulaila hasi kwedibome dya wabanike, nasikulombeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:2">nakulombeza wambizi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:2">weye niyo weva idizwi dyangu.<verse eid="JON 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 2:3" />Kunidula hasi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:3">mdani mwe ibahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:3">mabohwelo ya mazi niyo yanizunguluka ntendele zose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:3">Mawimbi yako yana nguvu yajubwanika mlanga mwangu. <verse eid="JON 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 2:4" />Niyo nafanya, sidulwa hale na weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:4">nisekudaha kuiwona naho Inyumba yako ikukile yo kuvikila.<verse eid="JON 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 2:5" />Mazi nayanizungulaka nakunijela chivuwanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:5">utali wa mazi unigubika chila hantu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:5">mani mwe bahali yanigubika umtwi.<verse eid="JON 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 2:6" />Nasiseleza hasi kubula kwe isi ya wabanike kudya kuhotele amagulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:6">isi iyo nyivi zakwe zivugalwa mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:6">mna weye Zumbe, Chohile ywangu kunikweza hatenda mjima kulaila mwe diya idibome.”<verse eid="JON 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 2:7" />“Muye wangu wize ukonge kunilawa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:7">sikukumbuka weye Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:7">malomezo yangu niyo yabula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:7">kwenyumbako nkulu yokuvikila ikukile.<verse eid="JON 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 2:8" />Wantu wakuvikila matukulu heyena chintu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:8">waleka uwedi wako.<verse eid="JON 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 2:9" />Mna miye nahuchemele kwa ntogozi kuno hakulaviza malavyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:9">na kuchintiza vyeliso vyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:9">Zumbe Chohile nuyo akwambula!”<verse eid="JON 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 2:10" />Elo, Zumbe Chohile niyo ailagiza idya isamaki imtahike Yona mpwani, niyo yamtahika.<verse eid="JON 2:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JON 3" />
  <para style="s">Yona aita komzi wa Ninawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 3:1" />Zumbe Chohile niyo alonga naho na Yona, <verse eid="JON 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 3:2" />amgamba vino, “Chimala wite komzi udya umkulu wa Ninawi ukawagambile wantu ulosi hwinkile.” <verse eid="JON 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 3:3" />Elo, Yona niyo azumila, aita komzi wa Ninawi saviya asigilwe ni Zumbe Chohile. Ninawi wendaga mzi ukulise, vimguha ntambo ya mazuwa matatu kuubinda. <verse eid="JON 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 3:4" />Yona eze engile mo mzi nakujenda kwa msi mjima, niyo akonga kulonga, “Yasigala mazuwa milongo mine mzi wa Ninawi naubalangwe!”<verse eid="JON 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 3:5" />Wantu wo mzi wa Ninawi niyo wauzumila ulosi wa Zumbe Chohile, watoilana luhugu wafunge, wavika suche za majuniya, kukongela mkulu kubula mdodo, kulagisa kugamba wamweila Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="JON 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 3:6" />Ulosi uwo wize umbwile seuta ywa Ninawi, niyo enuka mwe chigoda chakwe cho useuta, avula izisuche zo useuta avika suche za majuniya, ekala mwe maivu. <verse eid="JON 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 3:7" />Akaheza seuta niyo awatoila luhugu wantu wo umzi wa Ninawi, “Miye seuta hamwenga na vilongozi weyangu, nalavya lagizo dino, nimwiko mntu yoyose hegu ngombe hegu ludimo lolose nalume chintu chochose. Nimwiko mntu yoyose hegu ludimo kudya hegu kunywa. <verse eid="JON 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 3:8" />Wantu wose na ludimo wavike majuniya. Chila mntu amlombeze Zumbe Chohile kwa moyo na kumweila. Chila yumwenga aleke wavu na ubunyanyi wakwe. <verse eid="JON 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 3:9" />Mafani vyadahika Zumbe Chohile nahitwile fanyanyi zakwe za kuchiihiwa chani chisekubalangwa!”<verse eid="JON 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 3:10" />Zumbe Chohile eze awone ivyo wadamanye, nakuleka sila zawo zihiye, niyo ahitwila fanyanyi zakwe na kuleka kuwakantila saviya afanyanye.<verse eid="JON 3:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JON 4" />
  <para style="s">Yona ehiwa mbazi za Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 4:1" />Mna mbuli iyo haimwelele Yona hata hadodo, vyamtenda akwele maya vitendese. <verse eid="JON 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 4:2" />Elo, niyo amlombeza Zumbe Chohile. Agamba, “Ivyo nivyo namanyize kugamba nodamanye umo nendaga kwe isi yangu. Nivyo vilekile nahasumkila komzi wa Talishishi. Nasivimanya kugamba, weye Chohile kumema mbazi na kuwalekeila wata masa waneila, hukusunguza kwihiwa, naho wadaha kuhitwila fanyanyi zako usekukantila. <verse eid="JON 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 4:3" />Haluselo, Zumbe Chohile usa ujima wangu, kwaviya nivyedi nibanike ukaleka hatenda mjima.”<verse eid="JON 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 4:4" />Zumbe Chohile niyo amhitula Yona, “Wafanyanya kugamba wadamanya vyedi kwihiwa?”<verse eid="JON 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 4:5" />Yona niyo afosa umo mo mzi ahinga ntendele ya ulailo wa zuwa wo mzi uwo nakwikala hasi. Aho niyo azenga kumbi ekala mndanni mwakwe chani akaule chisimo nachilaile mo mzi wa Ninawi. <verse eid="JON 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 4:6" />Zumbe Chohile niyo ahoteza mfulula hadya eli Yona umwikiye mpeho. Chani amhunguzize nkuto. Mfulula uwo umwelelesa Yona. <verse eid="JON 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 4:7" />Mna zuwa dya kaidi kwize kuche, Zumbe Chohile niyo alagiza sondo idye uwo mfulula, uwo niyo wanyuluka. <verse eid="JON 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 4:8" />Zuwa dize dikwele, Zumbe Chohile niyo egala fukuto kulaila ntendele ya ulailo wa zuwa, zuwa dimokesa Yona mo mtwi niyo ehaguhi na kufa chififimbazi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 4:8">Niyo awona ni vyedi abanike, akagamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 4:8">“Ni vyedi nibanike ukaleka nikale.”<verse eid="JON 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 4:9" />Mna Chohile niyo amgamba Yona, “Wafanyanya kugamba wadanya vyedi kwihiwa kwachausa cha uwo umfulula?” Yona niyo ahitula, “Heye nadamanya vyedi kwihiwa naho hata kubanika!”<verse eid="JON 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 4:10" />Zumbe Chohile niyo amgamba Yona, “Mfulula uno uhota na kukula kwa chilo chimwenga du, chilo chitimile unyala. Weye huutendele chintu chochose, naho huuhandile. Ni mbwani waufila mbazi!? <verse eid="JON 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JON 4:11" />Elo, Togola haviniwagile niufile mbazi umzi mkulu udya wa Ninawi, uwo mndani mwakwe mna wana magana gana na magana milongo midi hewemanyize mbuli yedi na ihiye, naho mna ludimo lulozese!”<verse eid="JON 4:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 4" />
</usx>